# CHECK-NEXT: other 16 16 16 16 16 16 asked 0
# CHECK-NEXT: counter 1 3 5 7 9 11 asked 0
# CHECK-NEXT: source 5 5 5 5 5 5 asked 0
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
